  "description": "CR 508.1, 508.3a, 603.2c, 608.2c, 608.2d, 701.20e, 400.7, 603.6a, 611.2a: whenever one or more Birds alice controls attack, Choco has her look at one card per attacking Bird; she may put one into her hand, then any number of the lands among the rest onto the battlefield tapped, and the rest into her graveyard; a non-Bird attacking alone, or an opponent's Bird attacking, triggers nothing",
